<title>BAHRAIN: Saudi's Amiantit Co H1 97 net profit soars.</title>
<headline>Saudi's Amiantit Co H1 97 net profit soars.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1997-07-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>			   (million Saudi riyals)</p>
<p> Net income		 20.5   vs    4.9</p>
<p> Sales		     220.4   vs  163.3</p>
<p> Expenses		  178.1   vs  139.7</p>
<p> Shareholders' equity  385.1   vs  365.4</p>
<p> Assets		    949.4   vs  982.6</p>
<p>Full Name: Saudi Arabian Amiantit Company.</p>
<p>Note - The Dammam-based firm, which is traded in the Saudi market, specialises in the manufacture and sale of pipes and related products. -- Bahrain newsroom 973-524424</p>
</text>
